# CI & Pull Request Workflow

Before any PR or completion claim, run the **syllabus-planner-ci** skill:

`.cursor/skills/syllabus-planner-ci/SKILL.md`

## Mandatory

1. Execute `.cursor/skills/syllabus-planner-ci/scripts/run-ci.sh`
2. Fix failures and re-run until exit 0
3. Report results with evidence (see skill report format)
4. Only then create the PR

## After new commits on an open PR

Re-run the skill, then ask the user to re-run GitHub CI on the latest commit.

Do not assume earlier green checks still apply.
